ct and the team</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-sovereignty-also-rests-on-the-contract-and-the-team"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-10" playOrder="10"><navLabel><text>Plan the departure when the service arrives</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-plan-the-departure-when-the-service-arrives"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-11" playOrder="11"><navLabel><text>Sources and limits of this investigation</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch002.xhtml#c1-sources-and-limits-of-this-investigation"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-12" playOrder="12"><navLabel><text>2. One contract shapes the next</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml"/><navPoint id="nav-13" playOrder="13"><navLabel><text>Four bids within a boundary already drawn</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-four-bids-within-a-boundary-already-drawn"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-14" playOrder="14"><navLabel><text>France&apos;s defence ministry started with an installed base</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-frances-defence-ministry-started-with-an-installed-base"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-15" playOrder="15"><navLabel><text>A contract makes expansion easier</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-a-contract-makes-expansion-easier"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-16" playOrder="16"><navLabel><text>A staff group becomes an access rule</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-a-staff-group-becomes-an-access-rule"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-17" playOrder="17"><navLabel><text>The court also examines the years between contracts</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-the-court-also-examines-the-years-between-contracts"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-18" playOrder="18"><navLabel><text>Making room for the next choice</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch003.xhtml#c2-making-room-for-the-next-choice"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-19" playOrder="19"><navLabel><text>Sources and limits of the investigation</text></nav