.xhtml#c7-rehearsing-an-exit-while-the-service-still-works"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-61" playOrder="61"><navLabel><text>Responsibility beyond the next political term</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml#c7-responsibility-beyond-the-next-political-term"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-62" playOrder="62"><navLabel><text>Sources and limits of the investigation</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch008.xhtml#c7-sources-and-limits-of-the-investigation"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-63" playOrder="63"><navLabel><text>Conclusion: Passing on the ability to decide</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch009.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-64" playOrder="64"><navLabel><text>Visual reference</text></navLabel><content src="text/figures.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="nav-65" playOrder="65"><navLabel><text>Colophon and provenance</text></navLabel><content src="text/ch010.xhtml"/></navPoint></navMap></ncx>